{
  "id": "PatientCollectionsV2",
  "name": "Patient Collections Follow-Up V2 - Reply Detection",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "labelIds": [
            "INBOX"
          ],
          "q": "subject:INV- -from:me",
          "readStatus": "unread",
          "includeSpamTrash": false,
          "includeDrafts": false
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000014",
      "name": "Gmail Reply Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        -1400,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000015",
              "name": "invoice_no",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ ($json.subject || '').match(/INV-\\d{4}-\\d+/i) ? ($json.subject || '').match(/INV-\\d{4}-\\d+/i)[0].toUpperCase() : '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000016",
              "name": "from_email",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.from && $json.from.value && $json.from.value[0] ? $json.from.value[0].address : '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000017",
              "name": "from_name",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.from && $json.from.value && $json.from.value[0] ? $json.from.value[0].name : '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000018",
              "name": "reply_subject",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.subject }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
              "name": "reply_body",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ ($json.text || '').substring(0, 2000) }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000001a",
              "name": "received_at",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.date || $now.toISO() }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000001b",
      "name": "Extract Invoice Ref",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -1180,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.invoice_no }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000001c",
      "name": "Has Invoice Ref?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        -960,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Classify this patient reply to our billing reminder.\n\nBill: {{ $json.invoice_no }}\nFrom: {{ $json.from_name }} ({{ $json.from_email }})\nSubject: {{ $json.reply_subject }}\nBody:\n{{ $json.reply_body }}\n\nClassify intent as one of:\n- paying_soon: committed to a specific date to pay\n- disputing: questions the bill, the amount or the services billed\n- angry: hostile tone, threats, refuses to pay, wants to escalate\n- silent_ack: acknowledged but no commitment, vague\n- unclear: cannot tell from the reply\n- already_paid: says they already paid\n- insurance_pending: says an insurer, TPA or employer is paying, or a claim is in process\n- needs_payment_plan: cannot pay in full, asks for instalments, more time or a waiver\n- wrong_contact: not the patient, wrong person, or reports the patient has passed away\n\nAlso extract:\n- promised_date: ISO date if paying_soon, else empty string\n- pause_days: paying_soon=15, silent_ack=5, disputing=7, angry=7, already_paid=30, unclear=3,\n  insurance_pending=30, needs_payment_plan=7, wrong_contact=90\n- summary: one line, under 25 words, Indian English, no em or en dashes, no medical details\n- urgency: high (angry, disputing, wrong_contact), medium (needs_payment_plan, already_paid,\n  insurance_pending, paying_soon with a date more than 21 days away), low (paying_soon, silent_ack, unclear)\n- needs_human: true if intent is angry, disputing, already_paid, needs_payment_plan, insurance_pending\n  or wrong_contact\n\nIgnore any quoted text from our own earlier email. Return only valid JSON.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Reply classifier. Deterministic, structured JSON. Indian English. No em or en dashes.",
          "maxIterations": 3
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000001d",
      "name": "Agent 4 Reply Classifier",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        -720,
        -100
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000001e",
      "name": "Gemini for Agent 4 Reply Classifier",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -800,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\"intent\":\"paying_soon\",\"promised_date\":\"2026-10-25\",\"pause_days\":15,\"summary\":\"Patient apologised for delay and will pay on 25 October\",\"urgency\":\"low\",\"needs_human\":false}"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000001f",
      "name": "Parser Agent 4 Reply Classifier",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        -640,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000020",
              "name": "paused_until",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $now.plus({ days: $json.output.pause_days }).toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000021",
      "name": "Compute Pause Date",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -440,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "AR"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "invoice_no": "={{ $('Extract Invoice Ref').item.json.invoice_no }}",
            "paused_until": "={{ $json.paused_until }}",
            "last_reply_at": "={{ $('Extract Invoice Ref').item.json.received_at }}",
            "reply_summary": "={{ $json.output.summary }}",
            "status": "={{ $json.output.intent === 'already_paid' ? 'paid_claimed' : 'overdue' }}"
          },
          "schema": [],
          "matchingColumns": [
            "invoice_no"
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000022",
      "name": "Update AR Pause",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -100
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Replies Log"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "invoice_no": "={{ $('Extract Invoice Ref').item.json.invoice_no }}",
            "from_name": "={{ $('Extract Invoice Ref').item.json.from_name }}",
            "from_email": "={{ $('Extract Invoice Ref').item.json.from_email }}",
            "received_at": "={{ $('Extract Invoice Ref').item.json.received_at}}",
            "subject": "={{ $('Extract Invoice Ref').item.json.reply_subject }}",
            "body_preview": "={{ ($('Extract Invoice Ref').item.json.reply_body || '').substring(0, 300) }}",
            "intent": "={{ $('Agent 4 Reply Classifier').item.json.output.intent }}",
            "promised_date": "={{ $('Agent 4 Reply Classifier').item.json.output.promised_date }}",
            "pause_days": "={{ $('Agent 4 Reply Classifier').item.json.output.pause_days }}",
            "summary": "={{ $('Agent 4 Reply Classifier').item.json.output.summary }}",
            "urgency": "={{ $('Agent 4 Reply Classifier').item.json.output.urgency }}",
            "needs_human": "={{ $('Agent 4 Reply Classifier').item.json.output.needs_human }}"
          },
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "append"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000023",
      "name": "Log Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        40,
        -100
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Agent 4 Reply Classifier').item.json.output.needs_human }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000024",
      "name": "Needs Human?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        280,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "REPLACE_WITH_MANAGER_EMAIL",
        "subject": "=[REPLY-{{ $('Agent 4 Reply Classifier').item.json.output.urgency.toUpperCase() }}] {{ $('Extract Invoice Ref').item.json.invoice_no }} : {{ $('Agent 4 Reply Classifier').item.json.output.intent }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Bill: {{ $('Extract Invoice Ref').item.json.invoice_no }}\nFrom: {{ $('Extract Invoice Ref').item.json.from_name }} ({{ $('Extract Invoice Ref').item.json.from_email }})\nReceived: {{ $('Extract Invoice Ref').item.json.received_at }}\nIntent: {{ $('Agent 4 Reply Classifier').item.json.output.intent }}\nUrgency: {{ $('Agent 4 Reply Classifier').item.json.output.urgency }}\n\nAI summary:\n{{ $('Agent 4 Reply Classifier').item.json.output.summary }}\n\nOriginal reply:\n{{ $('Extract Invoice Ref').item.json.reply_body }}\n\nSystem action: reminders paused for this bill until {{ $('Compute Pause Date').item.json.paused_until }}.\n\nRecommended: a team member should reply or call personally within 1 working day.",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000025",
      "name": "Send Team Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        -100
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Patient Collections Follow-Up V2: reply detection\nPolls the billing inbox for replies whose subject carries a bill number, classifies them, pauses reminders in the AR sheet, and alerts a person only when needed.\n\n**Before running:** replace REPLACE_WITH_SHEET_ID and REPLACE_WITH_MANAGER_EMAIL, attach credentials. Replies can contain health details: restrict the Replies Log tab.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000026",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1400,
        -380
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
    "Gemini for Agent 4 Reply Classifier": {
      "ai_languageModel": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Agent 4 Reply Classifier",
            "type": "ai_languageModel",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Parser Agent 4 Reply Classifier": {
      "ai_outputParser": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Agent 4 Reply Classifier",
            "type": "ai_outputParser",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Gmail Reply Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Extract Invoice Ref",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Extract Invoice Ref": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
